<title>NETHERLANDS: NEDAP PROPOSES FOUR-FOR-ONE SHARE SPLIT.</title>
<headline>NEDAP PROPOSES FOUR-FOR-ONE SHARE SPLIT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nedap NV said on Wednesday it was proposing a four-for-one share split.</p>
<p>Nedap shares closed at 167.00 guilders on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
